        "original_id": "796bc49c-3725-5123-b816-1487d2d0b902",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: JYP Entertainment\n- Projects: JJ Project, Got7, Verse 2\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom\n- Topics: South Korean pop duo, South Korean boy group, debut releases\n\nFacts:\n- JJ Project is a South Korean pop duo consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JJ Project was formed by JYP Entertainment and released its first single, \"Bounce,\" in May 2012.\n- Got7 is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\n- Verse 2 is the first extended play by the South Korean male duo JJ Project.\n- Got7 is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP, \"Got It?,\" which reached number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.",
